	(text "VDD 5 V is required: 6 ports draw up to 0.74 A from RAW_5V. Bus pins +/-58 V abs, +/-45 V differential. STB tied to GNDIO for normal mode. IN grounded, OUT open: spare isolated GPIO.\nEN/FLT 10k pull-up: enabled, fault readable with a scope. Termination 120 Ohm by jumper per port, far end at the trunk."
